{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22142","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十三 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚王疑忠臣，江南放屈平。\n晋朝轻高士，林下弃刘伶。\n一人常独醉，一人常独醒。\n醒者多苦志，醉者多欢情。\n欢情信独善，苦志竟何成。\n兀傲瓮间卧，顦顇泽畔行。\n彼忧而此乐，道理甚分明。\n愿君且饮酒，勿思身後名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}